g observations from judgement. Deterministic producer probes are supporting evidence only and do not establish feel. If and only if both native routes behave correctly and no material playability blocker is observed, prepare one exact local founder ReviewTarget with controls, bounded feel question, restart/reconnect instructions, and explicit audio, loopback, and unverified-founder-taste limits. Do not publish, deploy, use external effects, broaden content, or claim founder acceptance.",
